    "body": "Follow-up to #712, also taking the opportunity to ask @jeisinger, @mikewest, @annevk and @domenic this:\n1. Should \"retrieved over an encrypted connection\" refer to secure origins, or is there a difference?\n2. Is there an important detail hiding in \"the address of the Document\", i.e. why isn't this algorithm just using the origin of the Document directly?\n",
